# Schemas turned into typed views.
#
# path (under schemas/) | namespace enum member and C# namespace | conventional prefix | role
#
# root:    every global element and complex type becomes a view.
# support: loaded so names resolve; a view is generated only for the types a root schema reaches.
#
# The Strict counterpart of an ecma376/transitional file is the file of the same name in ecma376/strict. It supplies the
# Strict namespace URI and extra enumeration values; the views are generated from the Transitional text.
# Names of views and members that differ from the schema's own are in names.manifest.
ecma376/transitional/wml.xsd|Wordprocessing|w|root
ecma376/transitional/shared-math.xsd|OfficeMath|m|root
ecma376/transitional/shared-commonSimpleTypes.xsd|SharedTypes|s|support
